    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Temptation at Sunset Cove</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Week of Sun. A Lifetime of Choices.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Ethan finally meets Lily\u2014the woman he's shared a long-distance digital romance with for two years\u2014the stage is set for a dream vacation at an exclusive tropical resort. But paradise has its price. Amidst sun-drenched beaches, hidden lagoons, and moonlit dinners, Ethan will face more than just rekindled passion. He'll navigate jealousy, temptation, and the kind of erotic discoveries that can either strengthen love... or destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Temptation at Sunset Cove</strong></i> is a <strong>fully voiced</strong> adult visual novel that puts you in control of Ethan\u2019s choices as he and Lily explore their relationship across a single unforgettable week. Will their bond survive the seductions of the resort? Or will new desires take root and blossom into something even more dangerous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Explicit, choice-driven storytelling</strong><br>\u2764\ufe0f <strong>Multiple relationship paths and endings</strong><br>\ud83c\udf34 <strong>Exotic resort setting with steamy, branching encounters</strong><br>\ud83d\udc94 <strong>Romance, drama, betrayal... and redemption</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673750/extras/c4640fc19d5be6c800a79efeaa7cc1bd.avif?t=1750132154\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you stay loyal, open your relationship, or give in to temptation, every decision leads to new possibilities\u2014and consequences. Will you chase fantasy, fight for love, or embrace the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One week. Every choice matters.</strong></p>",
